{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ShadowStrikeVR&quot; is a sniper-themed VR shooting game and an award-winning entry in the Qualcomm XR Contest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the protagonist &quot;Shadow,&quot; embarking on a journey from a simple revenge mission to gradually shouldering the responsibility of rebuilding the world order, ultimately undertaking a transcendent hunting spree across time and space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: Immersive sniper-themed storyline experience; deeply optimized interactive controls; a variety of cold and hot weapons and props; rich scene levels and mission modes; supports both single-player and multiplayer online modes, all designed to provide you with a new experience in VR sniper shooting games! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------Gorgeous Divider--------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Information:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For detailed game procedures and gameplay instructions, please refer to the &quot;ShadowStrikeVR Game Manual&quot; on this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to engage in discussions with the developers and other players, feel free to join the QQ group: 429947963.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2707000?t=1751026657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2707000?t=1751026657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751026657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751026657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ShadowStrikeVR&quot; is a sniper-themed VR shooting game and an award-winning entry in the Qualcomm XR Contest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the protagonist &quot;Shadow,&quot; embarking on a journey from a simple revenge mission to gradually shouldering the responsibility of rebuilding the world order, ultimately undertaking a transcendent hunting spree across time and space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: Immersive sniper-themed storyline experience; deeply optimized interactive controls; a variety of cold and hot weapons and props; rich scene levels and mission modes; supports both single-player and multiplayer online modes, all designed to provide you with a new experience in VR sniper shooting games! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------Gorgeous Divider--------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Information:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For detailed game procedures and gameplay instructions, please refer to the &quot;ShadowStrikeVR Game Manual&quot; on this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to engage in discussions with the developers and other players, feel free to join the QQ group: 429947963.</p>","developers":["Charming Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707000/header.jpg?t=1751026657","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Charming Game Studio.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/27070